# Lorcana Sealed Simulator

A Vue 3 web application simulating Lorcana Sealed format (opening boosters and building decks).

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Vue 3 with Composition API (`<script setup>`)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Build**: Vite
- **Data**: LorcanaJSON.org API (bundled JSON files)
- **Styling**: CSS with CSS Variables for theming

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── App.vue              # Main component with all business logic
├── components/
│   └── SingleCard.vue   # Card display component
└── data/sets/           # Card data by language/set
```

## Key Patterns

- All state management in App.vue using `ref()` and `reactive()`
- Card data loaded dynamically via `loadSetData(setCode, language)`
- CSS Variables for light/dark theme support
- Drag-and-drop + click buttons for card movement

